# 28. Cover Reservation

Tanpa reservation:

\`\`\`text
Enemy A → Cover 1
Enemy B → Cover 1
Enemy C → Cover 1
\`\`\`

Akibat:

\`\`\`text
●●●
\`\`\`

Enemy bertumpuk.

Dengan reservation:

\`\`\`text
Enemy A → Cover 1
Enemy B → Cover 2
Enemy C → Cover 3
\`\`\`

Konsep ini sangat penting dalam Multi-Agent AI.

