# 27. Membuat Scene

Simpan Scene sebagai:

\`\`\`text
PCG_Dungeon_Scene
\`\`\`

Hierarchy awal:

\`\`\`text
PCG_Dungeon_Scene
├── Main Camera
├── Directional Light
├── DungeonGenerator
└── LevelRoot
\`\`\`

---

# 28. Membuat Floor Prefab

Pilih:

\`\`\`text
GameObject
→ 3D Object
→ Cube
\`\`\`

Rename:

\`\`\`text
FloorPrefab
\`\`\`

Transform:

\`\`\`text
Position = (0, 0, 0)
Scale    = (1, 0.1, 1)
