# 29. Membuat Wall Prefab

Buat Cube.

Rename:

\`\`\`text
WallPrefab
\`\`\`

Transform:

\`\`\`text
Scale = (1, 1, 1)
\`\`\`

Material:

\`\`\`text
WallMaterial
\`\`\`

