# 29. Mendefinisikan Action

Kita gunakan enum:

\`\`\`csharp
public enum AgentAction
{
    Up = 0,
    Down = 1,
    Left = 2,
    Right = 3
}
\`\`\`

Mapping:

\`\`\`text
Up    → z + 1
Down  → z - 1
Left  → x - 1
Right → x + 1
