# 48. Layer Setup

Buat layer:

\`\`\`text
Player
Enemy
Obstacle
\`\`\`

Assign:

\`\`\`text
Player → Player
Enemy → Enemy
Walls → Obstacle
Obstacle objects → Obstacle
\`\`\`

Pada EnemyAI:

\`\`\`text
Obstacle Mask = Obstacle
\`\`\`

Pada PlayerCombat:

\`\`\`text
Hit Mask =
Enemy + Obstacle
\`\`\`

