# 13. Memahami Player Controller

Bagian:

\`\`\`csharp
Input.GetAxisRaw("Horizontal");
\`\`\`

membaca:

\`\`\`text
A / D
← / →
\`\`\`

Sedangkan:

\`\`\`csharp
Input.GetAxisRaw("Vertical");
\`\`\`

membaca:

\`\`\`text
W / S
↑ / ↓
\`\`\`

Arah gerakan:

\`\`\`text
                 +Z
                  ↑
                W / ↑
                  │
                  │

      A / ← ─── PLAYER ─── D / →

                  │
                  │
                S / ↓
                  ↓
                 -Z
\`\`\`

