Rekomendasi komposisi:

| Komponen | Bobot |
|---|---:|
| Tugas / Praktikum | 25% |
| Kuis / Konsep | 10% |
| UTS Mini Project | 20% |
| Progress Final Project | 10% |
| UAS Final Project | 35% |
