Mahasiswa mampu memahami dan menerapkan:
- randomness,
- seed,
- procedural spawning,
- random level,
- dungeon generation,
- grid-based generation,
- random walk,
- BSP,
- cellular automata,
- constraint-based generation.

Contoh:

\`\`\`text
Seed 12345 menghasilkan dungeon A
Seed 54321 menghasilkan dungeon B
Seed 12345 menghasilkan dungeon A lagi
\`\`\`

