---

# Slide 3 — Posisi Materi dalam Game Cerdas

Materi sebelumnya banyak membahas:

\`\`\`text
NPC Intelligence
├�”€─ Perception
├�”€─ Movement
├�”€─ Pathfinding
├�”€─ FSM
├�”€─ Behavior Tree
└�”€─ Tactical AI
\`\`\`

