Arena 10 x 10
Agent mulai di posisi random
Target muncul random
Jika agent mencapai target, reward +1
Jika agent jatuh, reward -1
Setiap step, penalty kecil
\`\`\`

Tentukan:
1. GameObject yang diperlukan.
2. Observation.
3. Action.
4. Reward.
5. Episode reset.
6. Debug UI.

